<title>USA: Florida BOE recalculated TIC.</title>
<headline>Florida BOE recalculated TIC.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida State Board of Education said Wednesday that it recalculated Prudential Securities winning bid on the $17.505 million refunding capital outlay bonds, 1996, Series B, which sold Wednesday Dec. 4. The State Board of Education said the true interest cost was 4.400, not 4.426 originally calculated.</p>
